+ *   - Bilinear: pass src as-is and retain the GMA filtered scaler.
+ *   - Nearest: select the GMA duplicate scaler when the firmware supports its
+ *     framebuffer ioctl; otherwise use the established device-safe fallback.
  *
  * Aspect-pad: when target aspect set, source is centered horizontally with
